, I wanted to clarify what the agreed upon shortcut since there were a couple ideas thrown out in this thread. If there's a specific way to go for that, let me know!! \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ea61270-492c-4320-b1dc-45d65be4364a","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2829120457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831387212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103272#issuecomment-2831387212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103272","id":2831387212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ow4pM","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T20:37:58Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T20:39:41Z","body":"I personally think that for GUI, adding toggle button and store default in editor setting would be recommended rather than adding more context menu items and would meet the needs of many users as commented in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103272#issuecomment-2698452637. The reason is that the most of users will always only select one of the options.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831387212/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2964099001","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103272#issuecomment-2964099001","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103272","id":2964099001,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wrI-5","user":{"login":"shadow-foss","id":144371189,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrt9Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144371189?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss","html_url":"https://github.com/shadow-foss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadow-foss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T20:42:57Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T20:42:57Z","body":"Hi! I noticed this issue hasn’t seen much recent activity, and I’ve already started working on a fix with